<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney ups 4 machinery cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney ups 4 machinery cos.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney raised its ratings on Case Corp, Caterpillar Inc, Deere &amp; Co and Parker-Hannifin Corp, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Upgraded Case and Caterpillar to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Upgraded Deere and Parker-Hannifin to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Case shares closed on Tuesday at 50-1/8. Caterpillar closed at 74, Deere closed at 43-3/8 and Parker-Hannifin closed at 40-1/4.</p>
</text>
